  "releaseNotes": "Added RecaptchaV3EnterpriseRequest (reCAPTCHA v3 Enterprise). New optional parameters: reCAPTCHA v2 Enterprise apiDomain/pageAction/cookies/userAgent, reCAPTCHA v2 isInvisible, reCAPTCHA v3 isEnterprise, Turnstile action, Prosopo userAgent, ComplexImageTask exampleImageUrls/exampleImagesBase64 and recognition metadata PayloadType, Hunt widgetUrl, Alibaba punishUrl/cookieRequired. Relaxed validation: Amazon WAF websiteKey/captchaScript/challengeScript/context/iv and ComplexImageTask websiteURL are optional; Imperva reese84UrlEndpoint and TenDI captchaUrl constructor parameters are optional. Responses now expose userAgent (FunCaptcha, reCAPTCHA v2/v3, Turnstile), cookies (reCAPTCHA v2) and metadata (grid ComplexImageTask).",
